stateDiagram-v2
    state stack_status <<choice>>
    [*] --> stack_status : cmd_deploy
    stack_status --> ABSENT
    stack_status --> CREATE_COMPLETE
    stack_status --> UPDATE_COMPLETE
    stack_status --> other_status : any other status

    ABSENT --> store_secret : deploy_script stack succeeds
    ABSENT --> [*] : stack step stopped, nothing pushed
    CREATE_COMPLETE --> store_secret : already deployed, skipped
    UPDATE_COMPLETE --> store_secret : already deployed, skipped
    other_status --> [*] : die, look at the stack in CloudFormation

    store_secret --> push_image : secret_is_set, or key stored
    push_image --> verify
    verify --> [*]
